I enter the doctor's room.
I sit on the chair in front of him.
The doctor asks me, "Are you well?"
I say, "No sir, today I am not well."
"Since morning, my health is not good."
He asks, "What is the problem?"
"Please tell me."
I point to my head.
I say, "There is a severe pain in my head."
"There is pain in my throat too."
"It is difficult even to drink water."
"My nose is also blocked."
"It is difficult to take a breath."
The doctor listens carefully and writes down the details.
He asks, "Is there a fever too?"
I say, "I do not know, but there is pain in my entire body."
"I am very tired."
The doctor says, "Do not worry, I will do an examination now."
